          "Decomposing complex distributed microservices into structured threat graphs requires formal state representations for trust boundaries, data flows, and architectural assets.",
          "An attack tree represents an adversary's ultimate objective as the root node of a directed acyclic graph, with subordinate intermediate milestones structured as logical AND/OR child nodes.",
