          "Inside `SafeSchemaUnmarshaller`, `unmarshal_json_strictly` parses raw text through `json.loads`, checks top-level dictionary types, rejects any undeclared property keys absent from `expected_schema`, and confirms every scalar field matches its declared Python runtime type cleanly. Enforcing exact schema keys and strict type constraints simultaneously defeats object pollution, prototype injection, and mass assignment attacks inside JSON API endpoints.",
